Source material
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The corpus behind this work is WildWorld, a research dataset recorded from a
photorealistic AAA action role-playing game by the authors on retail copies, and
released separately by Alaya Lab:

    https://github.com/AlayaLab/WildWorld
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/AlayaLab/WildWorld

Rights in the underlying game content remain with its publisher. Nothing in this
project grants any licence to that content.

Two files shipped here ARE unmodified recorded gameplay video, not model output:
data/first_frame_ref.mp4 and data/demo/aligned_ref.mp4. The observation model is
conditioned on a reference frame and these supply it; they are short clips from the
same recordings the corpus was built from, covered by LICENSE.assets. No game
textures, models or audio are redistributed. The seed states and scanned terrain are
numeric derivations produced by this work.
